Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:23.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にっ!　にこにこ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:00.87,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我的女兒豆豆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.92,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太溫柔了~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 快快 危機感!?
