Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:46.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.50,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.60,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:50.51,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
